     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The PR has been amended. There are some outstanding questions about including links to modeshape's github pages (URLs are too long for checkstyle rules; should I use a shortener service?), and the history of the ExternalJsonSidecarExtraPropertyStore class (the only way to preserve the history is to rename the file in one commit and then change it in a separate commit – is that what you'd like?)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
