     "body": "<p>The PR has been amended. There are some outstanding questions about including links to modeshape's github pages (URLs are too long for checkstyle rules; should I use a shortener service?), and the history of the ExternalJsonSidecarExtraPropertyStore class (the only way to preserve the history is to rename the file in one commit and then change it in a separate commit &#8211; is that what you'd like?)</p>",
